  "notes": {
    "t1": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "text": "VI design kit \u00b7 kit-test screens v3 \u00b7 glass, shell D, Steel on Graphite (provisional)",
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 4480
    },
    "s1": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": -200,
      "w": 1440,
      "text": "Light on a white base, shell D. Palette (provisional, 2026-11-03): Steel accent #477C8B on Graphite neutrals (ink #17151C, anchor #292531, secondary #45404F, muted #716879, tints from #E2DDE7); Vanguard red #96151D on the VI tile and critical only. Status glyph plus word. Jithin will revisit.",
      "size": "m",
      "fill": "gray"
    },
    "t2": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2520,
      "text": "Dark glass \u00b7 the engineering world",
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 4480
    },
    "t3": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4020,
      "text": "Navigation options \u00b7 pick one; the whole kit follows",
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 6000
    },
    "s3": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4120,
      "w": 1440,
      "text": "Decided 2026-11-03: D everywhere (dock inside the frame, top-anchored), light and dark. C2 was tried on the light screens and dropped: a permanent bar over the bottom of every table blocks the UI. A, B, C and C2 stay here as the record.",
      "size": "m",
      "fill": "gray"
    },
    "s2": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2620,
      "w": 1440,
      "text": "Dark on black, shell D. Rule (Jithin, 2026-11-03): black, nothing else. No tint, no glow: backdrop #000 with a neutral dot grid, panels rgba(16,16,16,.62), text #ECECEC, secondary #9A9A9A, anchor inverts to #E2E2E2. The only hue on the page is the lit thing and the brand red.",
      "size": "m",
      "fill": "gray"
    },
    "t4": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5600,
      "text": "Palette plates \u00b7 seven candidates on the same two screens",
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 10600
    },
    "s4": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5700,
      "w": 1440,
      "text": "Jithin's seven plates (2026-11-03), each applied the same way: Vanguard ink and brand red fixed (VI tile, critical); the plate supplies anchor, accent, secondary text and tints in light mode. Dark mode is black, nothing else, in every plate; the plate only supplies the lit colour. 1 Wine \u00b7 2 Steel \u00b7 3 Forest \u00b7 4 Navy \u00b7 5 Graphite \u00b7 6 Aqua \u00b7 7 Emerald depth.",
      "size": "m",
      "fill": "gray"
    },
